  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Next, Muranishi walks into a quiet Sapporo bookstore run by Kitamori and tries to place his magazines on the shelves. When Kitamori refuses, Muranishi unzipping his leather bag turns a rejected pitch into an unexpected job offer. Listen to their exchange in Japanese first without worrying about every detail.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "どうぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "こちらのお店には置いてありませんね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kitamori",
      "t": "いや、別に興味はありません。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "隠さなくて結構ですよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kitamori",
      "t": "ちょっと待ってください！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kitamori",
      "t": "うちではこういう本は置けません。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "そうですか。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "では、私の店にするしかありませんね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "こちらを買い取らせていただきたいのですが。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kitamori",
      "t": "この店に、こんなに？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "これは給料の前払いです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "どちらにしますか？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Both men speak with salesman-to-shopkeeper politeness even as Muranishi buys the store out from under Kitamori. Let's unpack how those polite turns work.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "どうぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Here you go.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "こちらのお店には置いてありませんね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You do not carry these in your shop, do you?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kitamori",
      "t": "いや、別に興味はありません。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No, I am not particularly interested.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "隠さなくて結構ですよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'There is no need to hide it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kitamori",
      "t": "うちではこういう本は置けません。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We cannot stock books like these in our shop.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "では、私の店にするしかありませんね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then I have no choice but to make this my shop.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "こちらを買い取らせていただきたいのですが。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I would like you to let me buy this place.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "これは給料の前払いです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This is an advance on your salary.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "どちらにしますか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Which one do you choose?'",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
